{
  "_comment": [
    "Hand-maintained mapping from OpenAI's public pricing page to pricing.json entries.",
    "No model list is held here: the page lists the models, under their API ids.",
    "",
    "`source` is the page's Markdown, which OpenAI serves beside every docs page (the",
    "page's address plus .md): every tab of the rendered page, as plain Markdown tables.",
    "",
    "`sections` and `speeds` are the lines that head the page's parts: a table belongs to",
    "the last section and the last speed above it. `tables` names every table read, by",
    "its section, its speeds and its header row, word for word, and says what its",
    "columns become. A table the page has and `tables` does not name is reported in the",
    "run's notes and not read; one named in `required_tables` that the page lacks fails",
    "the run. A Standard table gives a model's entry, a Batch table the `_batch` fields",
    "of the same entry, a Flex, Fast or Ultrafast table an entry of its own,",
    "`<id> (flex)`, `<id> (fast)`, `<id> (ultrafast)`.",
    "",
    "`long_context_note` is the sentence that says where long context starts:",
    "'Short context: ≤272K input tokens. Long context: >272K input tokens.' gives",
    "long_context_threshold 272001, K read as 1,000.",
    "",
    "Not published, and why (scripts/providers/openai/README.md says more): the models",
    "whose category carries `restricted_marker` ('Trusted Access'), sold only to",
    "organisations OpenAI approves; the sections in `sections_not_read`: fine-tuning,",
    "closed to new users, and the cloud platforms, which bill through their own pages."
  ],
  "source": "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/pricing.md",
  "sources": [
    "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/pricing.md"
  ],
  "format": "markdown",
  "currency": "USD",
  "sections": [
    "Flagship models",
    "Images",
    "GPT-Live",
    "Realtime & Audio",
    "Transcription",
    "Specialized models",
    "Tools",
    "Cloud platforms",
    "Fine-tuning"
  ],
  "sections_not_read": [
    "Fine-tuning",
    "Cloud platforms"
  ],
  "speeds": {
    "Standard": "Standard",
    "### Standard pricing data": "Standard",
    "Batch": "Batch",
    "### Batch pricing data": "Batch",
    "#### Batch": "Batch",
    "#### Flex": "Flex",
    "Fast": "Fast",
    "### Fast pricing data": "Fast",
    "Ultrafast": "Ultrafast",
    "### Ultrafast pricing data": "Ultrafast"
  },
  "long_context_note": "Short context: ≤(?P<short>[0-9]+)K input tokens\\. Long context: >(?P<long>[0-9]+)K input tokens\\.",
  "restricted_marker": "Trusted Access",
  "required_tables": [
    "flagship-context",
    "flagship-flat",
    "tools"
  ],
  "tables": [
